---
import SectionHeart from '../SectionHeart.astro';
---

  <section class="manifesto" id="why">
    <svg class="hcontour hc-tr" viewBox="157.6 139.7 936.4 949.4" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#mark"/></svg>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="manifesto-grid">
        <div>
          <SectionHeart tone="gold" class="reveal" />
          <h2 class="h-section reveal">Led by people who know every hallway. <span class="h-em">That is the Heartwell difference.</span></h2>
          <p class="lead reveal">Our founders spent their careers running skilled nursing communities as licensed administrators. At Heartwell, the people making capital and strategy decisions are the same people who understand surveys, staffing, reimbursement, and what actually happens in a hallway at 7am.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="manifesto-photo reveal">
          <img src="/img/embrace.jpg" alt="A caregiver's steady hand on a resident's arm during an activity" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar reveal">
          <h3>Operator-first ownership</h3>
          <p>Leadership works in the buildings, not just on calls. Ownership shows up, week after week, with staff and residents.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar reveal">
          <h3>Survey-ready from day one</h3>
          <p>Tight compliance infrastructure, honest engagement with regulators, and clinical standards that hold up under any inspection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar reveal">
          <h3>Grounded in reality</h3>
          <p>We know each building well before day one, and we arrive with a clear plan. We promise only what we can deliver.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
